 EF2 {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Enemy forces appear to be special forces from the Chernarus Defence Force. They've dismounted from their boats along the Zherebets river directly next to our foward river postion. "\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• Exepct drone support. It could be one, it could be two, droppers or FPV, just expect drones at all times."\
  "• Modern weaponry with all the gizmos and gadgets."\
  "• Night IR and low light capabilites."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• Enemy support capabilities are unknown."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 FF2 {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "We are the <b>2nd Motor Rifle Platoon, 1st Motor Rifle Company</b>, consisting of a platoon-plus strength. Our forces are dug into a defensive position along the Zherebets River, centred around the subterranean concrete bunker serving as our local HQ."\
  "Our squad starts at HQ."\
  ""\
  "Our foward unit in the riverside trench has withdrawn after coming under artillery bombardment and observing CDF forces making landfall along the river."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• We have a network of trenches containing several fighting positions and bunkers."\
  "• An NSV heavy machine gun is positioned at the marked location, providing significant firepower and coverage over the surrounding area."\
  "• Our subterranean concrete HQ provides a hardened defensive position and serves as the centre of our operations."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• None."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 MIS2 {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
  "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE DEFENCE</b> to <b>HOLD</b> our HQ and defensive positions against the assault."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "CDF special forces have established a position along the Zherebets River and are preparing to assault our defensive line. Their objective is to overrun our trench system and seize our subterranean HQ, which serves as the centre of our operations in the area."\
  ""\
  "The outer trench position near the river has already been abandoned following artillery strikes, leaving the remaining defensive positions exposed. We must use our prepared trenches, bunkers, and fighting positions to delay and repel the CDF assault."\
  ""\
  "<b>HOLD THE HQ.</b> Do not allow the CDF to occupy the bunker and take control of our position."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 SIT2 {
  coords 575.417 17.229 851.644
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
  "<b>DTL:</b> 01/08/2024, 0600hrs, Zarichne, Chernarus."\
  "<b>Weather:</b> Overcast, visibility 1km+, with a forecast of changing conditions."\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "Russia and Chernarus have been engaged in a large-scale conflict for the past two years, with fighting continuing across the country and along the front lines."\
  ""\
  "Throughout July, Chernarus Defence Forces have conducted a series of offensive operations against Russian positions in an effort to disrupt their presence and weaken their ability to operate throughout the region."\
  ""\
  "Zarichne has now become the focus of another operation. A Russian trench system on the outskirts of the a town, running along the Zherebets River, has been identified as a key defensive position supporting Russian operations in the area."\
  ""\
  "With both sides now committed to the area, fighting is expected to develop around the trench system and the nearby Russian headquarters. The outcome of the engagement could determine who maintains control of this section of Zarichne and the surrounding river line."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_AFRF"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
}